          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In general, "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "if a divides M and a divides N, then a divides M + N and a divides M – N. In other words, if M and N are multiples of a, then M + N and M – N will also be multiples of a.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
