              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_7_table_4.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td colspan=3>Explanation with Algebra and Visualisation</td><td>Examples</td></tr><tr><td>A numberdivisible by 8 isa multiple of 8.</td><td>8m</td><td rowspan=2>nrows  u(a+b) rows,            <img src=\"images/page_7_table_image_4_1.jpg\"/>b rowsoooo</td><td rowspan=2>8, 16, 56, 72.72 = 48 + 24(8×98×6+8×3).72 = 50 + 22</td></tr><tr><td>A numberdivisibleby 8 can beexpressed asa sum of twomultiples of 8 orsum of two non-multiples of 8.</td><td><eq>8m = 8a + 8b</eq>8m = p + q(p, q notmultiples of8)</td></tr></table>"
